'''Berserkers''' (バーサーカーズ, ''Bāsākāzu'', '''Berserkers''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (L): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 30%.

